      "message": "Twister should definitely be reporting skipped here, if it isn\u0027t it\u0027s a bug in twister.\n\nRegardless, zassume skipping a test but silently not failing in a build is not right and quite dangerous. See https://crrev.com/c/3937223, feel free to +2 or rebase off of it.",
